SF0162 Education-block grant model amendments.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Scott, Biteman, Brennan and Olsen and
Representative(s) Andrew and Schmid
AN ACT relating to school finance; restricting and amending the expenditure of
teacher resources and other funds generated by the education resource block
grant model as specified; requiring data collection; requiring reporting;
requiring a study; and providing for an effective date.
